ns">第一次参观卢浮宫</span></p><p begin="22.813" end="24.751" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.813" end="23.105">なん</span><span begin="23.105" end="23.219">て</span><span begin="23.219" end="23.367">こ</span><span begin="23.367" end="23.468">と</span><span begin="23.468" end="23.630">は</span><span begin="23.630" end="23.796">な</span><span begin="23.796" end="23.931">か</span><span begin="23.931" end="24.285">った</span><span begin="24.440" end="24.751">わ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却并不觉得震撼</span></p><p begin="24.976" end="26.568" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.976" end="25.373" amll:empty-beat="2">私</span><span begin="25.373" end="25.521">だ</span><span begin="25.521" end="25.647">け</span><span begin="25.647" end="25.769">の</span><span begin="25.769" end="25.933">モ</span><span begin="25.933" end="26.080">ナ</span><span begin="26.080" end="26.247">リ</span><span begin="26.247" end="26.568">ザ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我早已遇见</span></p><p begin="26.835" end="29.068" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.835" end="27.065">もう</span><span begin="27.117" end="27.302">と</span><span begin="27.414" end="27.553">っく</span><span begin="27.553" end="27.668">に</span><span begin="27.668" end="27.806">出</span><span begin="27.806" end="27.974">会</span><span begin="28.079" end="28.209">って</span><span begin="28.209" end="28.386">た</span><span begin="28.386" end="28.610">か</span><span begin="28.714" end="29.068">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独属于我的蒙娜丽莎</span></p><p begin="29.268" end="30.869" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.268" end="29.570" amll:empty-beat="1">初</span><span begin="29.570" end="29.714">め</span><span begin="29.714" end="29.847">て</span><span begin="29.847" end="29.976">あ</span><span begin="29.976" end="30.110">な</span><span begin="30.110" end="30.242">た</span><span begin="30.242" end="30.357">を</span><span begin="30.357" end="30.568">見</span><span begin="30.568" end="30.869">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">初遇你的那天起</span></p><p begin="31.129" end="33.443" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.129" end="31.262">あ</span><span begin="31.262" end="31.385">の</span><span begin="31.385" end="31.532">日</span><span begin="31.532" end="31.795" amll:empty-beat="1">動</span><span begin="31.795" end="31.958">き</span><span begin="31.958" end="32.092">出</span><span begin="32.092" end="32.245">し</span><span begin="32.245" end="32.360">た</span><span begin="32.360" end="32.503">歯</span><span begin="32.503" end="33.443" amll:empty-beat="2">車</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">齿轮便开始转动</span></p><p begin="33.546" end="37.661" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.546" end="33.703">止</span><span begin="33.703" end="33.838">め</span><span begin="33.838" end="33.981">ら</span><span begin="33.981" end="34.123">れ</span><span begin="34.123" end="34.248">な</span><span begin="34.248" end="34.366">い</span><span begin="34.366" end="34.699" amll:empty-beat="1">喪</span><span begin="34.699" end="35.361" amll:empty-beat="1">失</span><span begin="35.670" end="35.932">の</span><span begin="35.932" end="36.449">予</span><span begin="36.449" end="37.661">感</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却无法阻止丧失的预感</span></p></div><div begin="37.808" end="54.970" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="37.808" end="43.291" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.808" end="39.266">もう</span><span begin="39.459" end="39.915">い</span><span begin="39.988" end="40.537">っぱい</span><span begin="40.537" end="41.079">あ</span><span begin="41.079" end="41.293">る</span><span begin="41.293" end="41.914">け</span><span begin="41.914" end="43.279">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管已经拥有了很多</span></p><p begin="43.695" end="46.887" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.695" end="44.038">もう</span><span begin="44.038" end="44.539" amll:empty-beat="1">一</span><span begin="44.539" end="44.752">つ</span><span begin="44.752" end="45.041">増</span><span begin="45.041" end="45.279">や</span><span begin="45.279" end="45.609">し</span><span begin="45.609" end="45.759">ま</span><span begin="45.759" end="46.887">しょう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但让我们再多加一个吧</span></p><p begin="47.990" end="51.922" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.990" end="48.302">Can</span> <span begin="48.302" end="48.566">you</span> <span begin="48.566" end="49.158">give</span> <span begin="49.158" end="49.630">me</span> <span begin="49.630" end="49.887">one</span> <span begin="49.887" end="50.351">la</span><span begin="50.351" end="50.496">st</span> <span begin="50.496" end="51.755">ki</span><span begin="51.755" end="51.922">ss?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可以给我最后一吻吗？</span></p><p begin="52.295" end="54.970" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.295" end="52.854" amll:empty-beat="1">忘</span><span begin="52.854" end="53.103">れ</span><span begin="53.103" end="53.364">た</span><span begin="53.364" end="53.663">く</span><span begin="53.663" end="53.963">な</span><span begin="53.963" end="54.184">い</span><span begin="54.184" end="54.465">こ</span><span begin="54.465" end="54.970">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想忘却</span></p></div><div begin="54.990" end="1:03.533" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="54.990" end="57.081" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.990" end="55.169">Oh</span> <span begin="55.363" end="55.574">oh</span> <span begin="55.757" end="56.027">oh</span> <span begin="56.173" end="56.424">oh</span> <span begin="56.557" end="57.081">oh</span></p><p begin="57.101" end="59.204" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.101" end="57.326">Oh</span> <span begin="57.503" end="57.719">oh</span> <span begin="57.909" end="58.122">oh</span> <span begin="58.331" end="58.726">oh-</span><span begin="58.726" end="59.204">woah</span></p><p begin="59.237" end="1:00