n="1:33.002" end="1:33.415">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但其实 在这方面我们都一样</span></p><p begin="1:33.435" end="1:35.111" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.435" end="1:33.708" amll:empty-beat="1">誰</span><span begin="1:33.708" end="1:33.837">か</span><span begin="1:33.837" end="1:33.947">を</span><span begin="1:33.947" end="1:34.235" amll:empty-beat="1">求</span><span begin="1:34.235" end="1:34.354">め</span><span begin="1:34.354" end="1:34.491">る</span><span begin="1:34.491" end="1:34.611">こ</span><span begin="1:34.611" end="1:34.817">と</span><span begin="1:34.817" end="1:35.111">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对某个人的渴望</span></p><p begin="1:35.401" end="1:37.534" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.401" end="1:35.837" amll:empty-beat="2">即</span><span begin="1:35.837" end="1:35.948">ち</span><span begin="1:35.948" end="1:36.218" amll:empty-beat="1">傷</span><span begin="1:36.218" end="1:36.349">つ</span><span begin="1:36.349" end="1:36.487">く</span><span begin="1:36.487" end="1:36.623">こ</span><span begin="1:36.623" end="1:36.773">と</span><span begin="1:36.773" end="1:36.918">だ</span><span begin="1:37.044" end="1:37.534">った</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说到底就是一种伤</span></p></div><div begin="1:37.841" end="1:54.913" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:37.841" end="1:43.316" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.841" end="1:39.369">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:39.430" end="1:39.714">can</span> <span begin="1:39.714" end="1:39.979">you</span> <span begin="1:39.979" end="1:40.569">give</span> <span begin="1:40.569" end="1:41.084">me</span> <span begin="1:41.084" end="1:41.352">one</span> <span begin="1:41.352" end="1:41.782">la</span><span begin="1:41.782" end="1:41.945">st</span> <span begin="1:41.945" end="1:43.168">ki</span><span begin="1:43.168" end="1:43.316">ss?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢，可以给我最后一吻吗？</span></p><p begin="1:43.